                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Oldie fun if you don't mind the jank and the fact that u spend most of the time walking around to different locations. \nNeat that you can play it easily over a weekend, should take you aroun 14ish hours to do every quest possible. A bit easy once you have decent Army and your Hero can't get oneshot.\n\nWould reccomend you boot it up with something like DxWnd to have that modern aspect ratio. (Steam however will not count playtime).\n\n",
